  "cves": [
    "CVE-2026-13757",
    "CVE-2026-18938"
  ],
  "description": "It was discovered that p11-kit incorrectly handled certain RPC messages. A\nlocal attacker could use this issue to cause p11-kit to crash, resulting in\na denial of service. (CVE-2026-13757)\n\nIt was discovered that p11-kit incorrectly handled nested attribute\ndecoding on 32-bit systems. A local attacker could use this issue to cause\np11-kit to crash, resulting in a denial of service. (CVE-2026-18938)",
  "id": "USN-8687-1",
  "isummary": "p11-kit could be made to crash if it received specially crafted input.",
